{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17922","headline":"琴操十首 · 韩愈","name":"琴操十首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"父兮儿寒，母兮儿饥。\n儿罪当笞，逐儿何爲。\n儿在中野，以宿以处。\n四无人声，谁与儿语。\n儿寒何衣，儿饥何食。\n儿行於野，履霜以足。\n母生衆儿，有母怜之。\n独无母怜，儿宁不悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}